			"Message": "chore(Project): Coordinate Element submodule updates across 3 components\n\nSynchronize Mountain, Cocoon, and Rest submodules with the following changes:\n\n**Refactoring & Naming Convention:**\n- Mountain: Adopt PascalCase naming throughout — rename all snake_case module files (CodeActions.rs, InvokeProvider.rs, ReadOperations.rs, WriteOperations.rs, EntryManagement.rs, MessageManagement.rs, EchoAction.rs). Simplify binary/library names in Cargo.toml and tauri.conf.json, removing verbose development identifiers and externalBin references.\n- Rest: Rename private_field.rs to PrivateField.rs to follow PascalCase convention.\n- Cocoon: Rename performance-benchmark.js to PerformanceBenchmark.js.\n\n**Bug Fixes & Improvements:**\n- Cocoon: Change extension storage path from `~/.codeeditorland/extensions/storage` to `~/.codeeditorland/extensionStorage` to avoid Mountain scanner warnings. Enhance MakePermissiveExports with multi-stub handling for all VS Code extension idioms (callable, iterable, chainable) to prevent activation failures.\n\nThese changes align all components with the CodeEditorLand PascalCase naming convention and fix extension host issues.",
