			],
			"Message": "chore(Project): Coordinate Element submodule updates across 4 components\n\nSynchronize Mountain, Sky, Output, and Cocoon submodules with the following changes:\n\n**Features & Improvements:**\n- Mountain: Configure dev node environment with verbose binary/library naming, add VS Code-style extension scanning paths (~/.codeeditorland/extensions, ~/.land/extensions), fix Cocoon health monitor to stop log flooding after crashes, add IPC stub handlers for Debug.Stop, Task.Fetch/Execute, Authentication, Clipboard, and NativeHost APIs\n- Sky: Add Public/product.json configuration with application metadata (name, version, data folder, license, documentation URLs)\n\n**Dependency Updates:**\n- Output: Bump typescript 6.0.2 → 6.0.3\n\nThis coordinated update ensures all components are synchronized with latest features, dependency improvements, and editor metadata configuration.",
